  <circuit name="main">
    <comp lib="11" loc="(10,10)" name="Text">
      <a name="background" val="#ff2cf12c"/>
      <a name="format" val="markdownish"/>
      <a name="text">A custom-built GPU has been implemented within logisim by **Mark Craig** of [MrMcsoftware](https://github.com/mrmcsoftware).
* You can download the Jar Library providing the custom GPU, along with example circuits, at [https://github.com/mrmcsoftware/GPU4Logisim](https://github.com/mrmcsoftware/GPU4Logisim).
* Videos of the GPU in action can be seen on Mark Craig's [youtube channel](https://www.youtube.com/MrMcSoftware).

Here's a screenshot showing some of the results!
</a>
      <a name="textwidth" val="774"/>
    </comp>
